// "Domain" ([CR#207.2c] ability word): the number of basic land types among
// the lands you control — a `Count`-position name for the distinct-union
// count over the BASIC land-type axis ([CR#205.3i]: Forest, Island,
// Mountain, Plains, and Swamp are the basic land types). Each land you
// control contributes only its basic land types to the union — a Gate's
// `Gate` subtype never counts — so the axis is `BasicLandTypes`, never the
// whole `Subtypes` axis.
(
    name: "Domain",
    template: "domain",
    kinds: [Count],
    body: CountDistinct(BasicLandTypes, Objects(AllOf([InZone(Battlefield), Type(Land), ControlledBy(Ref(You))]))),
)
